  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Urban Water Programme Feasibility Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To carry out a comprehensive social and technical assessment of the current water and sanitation infrastructure, usage and management in Livingstone Urban over a period of 40 days.
To examine the opportunities for CAFOD to meaningfully and sustainably contribute towards increasing access to water for personal and domestic use and improving sanitation at a household and community level.</narrative>
  </description>
